[thin] Accepted wing fit: each reading is one of the plate's two horizontal wings, 1.68 mm thick and projecting 2.40 mm, the thickness of the accepted horizontal-wing fit (horizontal-wing-trial/physical-acceptance.json); the receiver's 2.13 mm slot keeps its 1.23 mm retaining lip over it.
alternatives: A thicker wing needs a thicker plate or a thinner lip, each a change to the accepted fit.
